 E'Cinnamon Brown handmade khaddar from Kamalia, woven on a traditional khaddi (hand loom). Colour: warm cinnamon brown, solid and even.\nThe Pure range is plain, solid-colour khaddar with an even weave. Easy to wear to the office, Friday prayers or a family dinner.\n• Code: PH-07\n• Range: Pure Handmade Khaddi 2025-26\n• Fabric: handloom khaddar, unstitched\n• Best for: office wear, Friday prayers, weddings, Eid and winter family events\n• Comes with 4 matching buttons\n\nQuick answers\n• Is it stitched? No. This is unstitched fabric, so your tailor can cut it exactly to your size and style.\n• Is it real handloom khaddar? Yes, woven on a traditional khaddi in Kamalia, which is why the texture is uneven in a good way.\n• Want more than one? Add several colours to your cart and check out once.\nThe photo shows the real fabric. Colours can look slightly different on different screens.'),
